			<div class="content" id="post-content-1773557">
									

<p>People who read my two SCPs will think I have something against children, but it's actually the opposite. It is said we should figure out what scares us the most and I realized while writing this that for me it's bad thing happening to kids. Books about children, like <em>Black House</em> or <em>Gone, Baby Gone</em> are always more horrifying to me.</p>
